"x-2114148021910765740","post_id":"2114148021910765740","platform":"x","author":"nayibbukele","original_url":"https://x.com/nayibbukele/status/2114148021910765740","published_at":"2026-10-25T00:12:22.051Z","published_date":"2026-10-25","date_precision":"millisecond","source_ids":["nitter-public-timeline"],"text":"No son nuestros hombres.\n\nUna ONG entregó restos humanos en el aeropuerto, asegurando que pertenecían a nuestros cuatro aerotécnicos.\n\nSin embargo, los restos corresponden a un niño, a un hombre de una estatura considerablemente mayor que la de nuestros aerotécnicos y a una persona que portaba parte de un uniforme de un ejército que no es el nuestro.\n\nEntre los restos también se encontraron carnets de identificación y uniformes militares de otros países.","post_kind":"quote","is_repost":false,"author_verified":true,"like_count":57140,"likes_captured_at":"2026-10-28T23:51:54.990547+00:00","likes_source":{"provider":"nitter-public-timeline","url":"https://nitter.jaydenha.uk/nayibbukele/with_replies","sha256":"94fece684faeb90000993a678ecc4d23aa2b1d76b35f7cd891a3c8c62f51fc45","count_precision":"exact-displayed-integer","capture_precision":"collection-run-start","selection_policy":"latest-known-snapshot; minimum on same-time conflict"},"text_status":"captured_displayed_source_text","text_source":"https://nitter.jaydenha.uk/nayibbukele/with_replies","text_truncated":false},{"id":"x-2113691868424740980","post_id":"2113691868424740980","platform":"x","author":"nayibbukele","original_url":"https://x.com/nayibbukele/status/2113691868424740980","published_at":"2026-10-23T17:59:46.585Z","published_date":"2026-10-23","date_precision":"millisecond","source_ids":["nitter-public-timeline"],"text":"Muchos mensajes, análisis y comentarios como este, asegurando que las pandillas de Haití no son como las de El Salvador; que son sanguinarias, que están fuertemente armadas, que nadie ha podido vencerlas, que todas las misiones han fracasado, que estamos cayendo en una trampa, que no sabemos a lo que nos enfrentamos, que será nuestra ruina, que vamos camino a nuestro Waterloo.\n\nPero cuando Dios nos conceda la victoria, los mismos que hoy dicen todo eso cambiarán su discurso. Dirán que siempre fue fácil, que cualquiera podía hacerlo, que las pandillas de Haití no eran tan peligrosas como se pensaba.\n\nEn fin, nunca los hemos escuchado y no vamos a empezar ahora.\n\nTodos los que se han enlistado son creyentes y hemos encomendado esta misión a Dios, mientras que las pandillas de Haití son satá…","post_kind":"quote","is_repost":false,"author_verified":true,"like_count":139956,"likes_captured_at":"2026-10-28T23:51:54.990547+00:00","likes_source":{"provider":"nitter-public-timeline","url":"https://nitter.jaydenha.uk/nayibbukele/with_replies","sha256":"94fece684faeb90000993a678ecc4d23aa2b1d76b35f7cd891a3c8c62f51fc45","count_precision":"exact-displayed-integer","capture_precision":"collection-run-start","selection_policy":"latest-known-snapshot; minimum on same-time conflict"},"text_status":"captured_displayed_source_text","text_source":"https://nitter.jaydenha.uk/nayibbukele/with_replies","text_truncated":true},{"id":"x-2112981920741310695","post_id":"2112981920741310695","platform":"x","author":"nayibbukele","original_url":"https://x.com/nayibbukele/status/2112981920741310695","published_at":"2026-10-21T18:58:41.867Z","published_date":"2026-10-21","date_precision":"millisecond","source_ids":["nitter-public-timeline"],"text":"Pou chèf gang yo ak manm gang yo k ap kenbe kat konpatriyòt nou yo an otaj ann Ayiti:\n\nMesye nou kidnape yo pa konbatan. Yo se teknisyen nan domèn avyasyon ki fè pati misyon nou ann Ayiti, nan kad yon misyon entènasyonal. Misyon nou an gen sèlman pilòt ak pèsonèl teknik, ki gen kòm travay prensipal fè evakyasyon medikal epi sove lavi moun, pa fè lagè.\n\nMen, nou te kidnape yo yon fason lach pandan yo t ap retounen apre yo te fin achte manje nan yon makèt nan zòn nan.\n\nSe poutèt sa, jodi a nou te lanse yon operasyon militè pou pote yo sekou. Nou gen yon sèl objektif: fè kat konpatriyòt nou yo retounen lakay yo vivan, san okenn mal.\n\nMen, mwen vle pou nou menm, chèf gang yo, konprann yon bagay byen klè: atak jodi a pa anyen devan sa k ap vini si nou pa remèt toule kat otaj yo vivan.\n\nEpi pa …","post_kind":"original","is_repost":false,"author_verified":true,"like_count":188208,"likes_captured_at":"2026-10-28T23:51:54.990547+00:00","likes_source":{"provider":"nitter-public-timeline","url":"https://nitter.jaydenha.uk/nayibbukele/with_replies","sha256":"94fece684faeb90000993a678ecc4d23aa2b1d76b35f7cd891a3c8c62f51fc45","count_precision":"exact-displayed-integer","capture_precision":"collection-run-start","selection_policy":"latest-known-snapshot; minimum on same-time conflict"},"text_status":"captured_displayed_source_text","text_source":"https://nitter.jaydenha.uk/nayibbukele/with_replies","text_truncated":true},{"id":"x-2111912919243878739","post_id":"2111912919243878739","platform":"x","author":"nayibbukele","original_url":"https://x.com/nayibbukele/status/2111912919243878739","published_at":"2026-10-18T20:10:52.049Z","published_date":"2026-10-18","date_precision":"millisecond","source_ids":["nitter-public-timeline"],"text":"Siempre nos dijeron que vivir en paz era imposible, hasta que demostramos que sí se podía.\n\nGracias a Dios, nunca los escuchamos.\n\nHoy, más que nunca, estoy convencido de que esto es posible en cualquier lugar. Y nuestros hermanos de Costa Rica también van a lograrlo 🇸🇻🇨🇷","post_kind":"original","is_repost":false,"author_verified":true,"like_count":59333,"likes_captured_at":"2026-10-28T23:51:54.990547+00:00","likes_source":{"provider":"nitter-public-timeline","url":"https://nitter.jaydenha.uk/nayibbukele/with_replies","sha256":"94fece684faeb90000993a678ecc4d23aa2b1d76b35f7cd891a3c8c62f51fc45","count_precision":"exact-displayed-integer","capture_precision":"collection-run-start","selection_policy":"latest-known-snapshot; minimum on same-time confli